{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|πᾶν||all}} + {{m|grc|ὀπτικός||visible}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A type of [[prison]], designed by [[philosopher]] Jeremy Bentham, wherein all the [[cell]]s are visible from the center of the building. It engenders a feeling of being watched.
# A room for the exhibition of novelties.

